{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Gx7ANo4ByR3HzHp4kDYkzQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:38.895157+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Gx7ANo4ByR3HzHp4kDYkzQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/CbKlzGU0hrZ6NreJpib6uf8ktiaZDUZ1Kias0f12aMM5MibGSpDRb0wvyVKE74QMogIHauf6g2Wd56YEzIXicqgibV5OIwpcTwtDric5QcXeL2gaCk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>以下专业全日制普通高等学校本科2023级在校学生（拟2027年毕业），且有意向报考我所者：</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>化学领域</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>应用化学、化学生物学、分子科学与工程、能源化学、资源化学等。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>化工领域</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>化学工程与工艺、制药工程、资源循环科学与工程、能源化学工程、化学工程与工业生物工程、化工安全工程</span><span><span>等。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>3</span></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>材料领域</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>材料科学与工程、材料物理、材料化学、高分子材料与工程、无机非金属材料工程、复合材料与工程、材料成型及控制工程、矿物加工工程等。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请人须满足以下条件之一</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>本科期间学习成绩优秀，总评成绩排名在本学院或本专业前20%以内；</span></p><p><span>具有或即将获得推荐免试研究生资格。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/CbKlzGU0hrZ03DYOhqFQVEVOxzUtia3YJn6Neam5ibYSoFk87nO5PrT5nHkn6l6Zkd5ktZiaWSwTF78Q0OSpUDofCTsm1m7qYX0yia1DbTVbyEI/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>1. </span><strong><span>报名时间：</span></strong><span><strong><span>自即日起至2026年6月30日</span></strong></span></p><p><span>2. </span><strong><span>网上报名：</span></strong><span>注册登录夏令营申请系统http://zxsq.ucas.ac.cn/login/index/sc，承办单位选择“山西煤炭化学研究所”，夏令营名称选择“煤好未来·由你炭索”优秀大学生夏令营，进行报名。</span></p><p><span>3. 报名后须将以下材料按顺序扫描合并成一个PDF文档，并发送至</span><span><strong><span>yzb@sxicc.ac.cn</span></strong></span><span>，邮件命名为：</span><span><strong><span>××高校-××学院（系）-××专业-姓名</span></strong></span><span>。</span></p><p><span>（1）中国科学院大学2026年夏令营申请表扫描件（</span><strong><span><span>报名系统生成，须本人签字</span></span></strong><span>）；</span></p><p><span>（2）本科成绩单和专业排名证明扫描件（</span><strong><span><span>需加盖教务处公章</span></span></strong><span>）；</span></p><p><span>（3）个人简历（A4一页）和学生证扫描件；</span></p><p><span>（4）英语水平证明（如国家英语四、六级考试成绩、或TOEFL成绩、或GRE成绩等）扫描件；</span></p><p><span>（5）对申请有参考价值的其他材料扫描件（如已发表论文的首页、奖状、各类证书等，可自愿提交）</span></p><p><span><strong><span>注：申请者应保证申请时所提交的所有电子信息及纸版材料的真实性、有效性、完整性，因不实信息或者伪造材料所造成的后果完全由本人承担！</span></strong></span></p><p><span>4. </span><strong><span>录取方式：</span></strong><span>研究所将根据学生报名系统填写内容和邮箱提供的电子材料进行筛选，</span><span><span>拟接收的夏令营学员将于</span><span><strong><span>2026年7月5日</span></strong><span><span>左右</span></span></span><span>公布并通过邮件通知</span></span><span>，</span><strong><span><span>入选营员须准备相关纸质版材料（签字、盖章）。届时未接到录取通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/CbKlzGU0hrbnicO1zEHl8icT36nID9N8Rdajucus3jv4ojIqqtiaX7s4WuB5XLIroYX3UzQRnrImggI29X1T2wBbQ808QTTyxKUPNibnOU4A02o/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>1. 营员须遵守山西煤化所相关规定，服从统一安排。</span></p><p><span>2. </span><strong><span>我所统一提供餐饮及住宿，并报销来程路费。</span></strong></p><p><span>3. </span><strong><span>报销范围：</span></strong><strong><span><span>仅限报到当日从家庭/学校所在地至太原的交通费用。</span></span></strong></p><p><span>4. </span><strong><span>报销标准：</span></strong></p><p><span><strong><span>火车：硬座或硬卧</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>高铁/动车：二等座</span></strong></span></p><p><span><strong><span>飞机：最高按同区间高铁/动车二等座最低票价报销</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy